@base = http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1

### Service state and model versions
GET {{base}}/meta

### Vendors available to the frontend
GET {{base}}/vendors

### Search by reference, brand, or designation
GET {{base}}/articles?query=huile&limit=10

### Replace V001 with a code returned by /vendors
GET {{base}}/vendors/V001/repurchases?limit_clients=20&per_client=3

### Replace both identifiers with values returned by discovery endpoints
GET {{base}}/vendors/V001/articles/ART00001/prospects?limit=5

### Preferred article-page request: both "Ils l'achetaient" and "À prospecter"
GET {{base}}/vendors/V001/articles/ART00001/recommendations?limit=5
